This image redistributes the upstream backube snapscheduler operator, built
from source at a pinned release tag. The operator is the substance of the image.
Our wrapper only cross-compiles it. The full license text of each component
travels inside the image (this LICENSE, LICENSE.apache-2.0.txt, and the Go
module licenses linked into the binary).

